{"4173010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ninja JaJaMaru: Yokai Night Parade", "steam_appid": 4173010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Searching for the kidnapped Princess Sakura, JaJaMaru strays into an otherworldly dungeon.<br>There, he discovers a Yokai Night Parade party where hordes of yokai are dancing and partying away!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defeat wave after wave of incoming yokai as you explore the dungeon in search of powerful equipment.<br>With Ninja Swords, Kusarigama, Shuriken, and more, there are over 300 types of equipment to collect!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pass through the glowing torii gates that appear inside the dungeon to enter the &quot;Yokai Night Parade,&quot; where you battle yokai under special rules!<br>Challenge boss yokai as they lead massive hordes and show off their unique dance moves.<br>Emerge victorious, and a wealth of loot awaits!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you clear dungeons, you’ll unlock a variety of Ninpo.<br>Master these flashy, ultra-powerful Ninpo skills to sweep away hordes of yokai all at once.<br>JaJaMaru's familiar sidekick, Gama Pakkun, makes an appearance too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At JaJaMaru's room, which serves as your home base, you can power up your stats, upgrade your gear, and more.<br>You can also decorate the room to your liking using furniture items acquired in the dungeons.<br>Furniture items even grant stat boosts to JaJaMaru.<br><br>Once you’re fully prepared, head back into the dungeons!<br>Factories, yokocho alleys, onsen, snowy mountains... formidable foes await you in every region.<br>Defeat Nurari Pyoko, the Yokai Supreme Commander plotting the grandest Yokai Night Parade in history, and rescue Princess Sakura!", "about_the_game": "Searching for the kidnapped Princess Sakura, JaJaMaru strays into an otherworldly dungeon.<br>There, he discovers a Yokai Night Parade party where hordes of yokai are dancing and partying away!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4d7d5927d7cc57839af67550c858a796.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defeat wave after wave of incoming yokai as you explore the dungeon in search of powerful equipment.<br>With Ninja Swords, Kusarigama, Shuriken, and more, there are over 300 types of equipment to collect!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4f5dbfd4e8d7afae5889400b03703e19.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pass through the glowing torii gates that appear inside the dungeon to enter the &quot;Yokai Night Parade,&quot; where you battle yokai under special rules!<br>Challenge boss yokai as they lead massive hordes and show off their unique dance moves.<br>Emerge victorious, and a wealth of loot awaits!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/4b98df097729142dabda348eb128b786.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you clear dungeons, you’ll unlock a variety of Ninpo.<br>Master these flashy, ultra-powerful Ninpo skills to sweep away hordes of yokai all at once.<br>JaJaMaru's familiar sidekick, Gama Pakkun, makes an appearance too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.poster.avif?t=1787822607\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.webm?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/extras/6ad14c4fa55af0bfaf5622407919d774.mp4?t=1787822607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At JaJaMaru's room, which serves as your home base, you can power up your stats, upgrade your gear, and more.<br>You can also decorate the room to your liking using furniture items acquired in the dungeons.<br>Furniture items even grant stat boosts to JaJaMaru.<br><br>Once you’re fully prepared, head back into the dungeons!<br>Factories, yokocho alleys, onsen, snowy mountains... formidable foes await you in every region.<br>Defeat Nurari Pyoko, the Yokai Supreme Commander plotting the grandest Yokai Night Parade in history, and rescue Princess Sakura!", "short_description": "Ninja JaJaMaru-kun returns in a yokai-filled hack-and-slash action game! Stray into a dungeon party, defeat dancing yokai, master flashy Ninpo, and amass an arsenal of ninja gear! Clear special &quot;Yokai Night Parade&quot; rules for loot, decorate your base for stat boosts and save Princess Sakura!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/09d69a32fa253ad6bfc87fded8ead441939f9acb/header.jpg?t=1787822607", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/9f840566a66062c21b3442b7394766e46e130097/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787822607", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173010/9f840566a66062c21b3442b7394766e46e130097/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787822607", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-6500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>